# Without this, api/client.ts's resolveBaseUrl() falls back to guessing --
# `${hostname}:8787` on web (wrong port; nothing of ours listens there) or
# literally "localhost" on native (the device itself, never a real server).
# Both are dead ends, so every real build needs the actual API origin baked
# in explicitly at build time.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://itssophie.dev/cortex-api
